@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:为了制造不在场证明，<br>她不得不<br>利用我……<br>原来是这么一回事。|#0201Trial12_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ENDIF 分岐終了

# Judge_6-12-5_skip2

